    "turn_text": "Well, I, frankly, at this juncture, I'm doubtful that it will of naked to the house, I'm frankly dubious that it would be past the Senate. And the last time I looked closely at Grand Cassidy was about last March or April, and I was, frankly, skeptical of its impact upon our state at that time. But we are on a district work week now, so I am waiting to get a briefing from the health staff in the house so that I can better formulate a position on it. But as I said, I'm pretty skeptical of the approach that they're taking. And I do think that it would have an overly broad and dramatically negative impact from what my recollection was of the discussion back in April on our state.",
